  m_text: 'You will now experience an autonomous vehicle driving around a predefined
    track with a randomized driving style. After each lap, the simulation will pause
    and you will be asked do give feedback about the previous driving style.


    This
    is done via a slider (ranging from "strongly disagree" to "strongly agree") and
    four sets of buttons. You don''t have to make a selection for every set. Afterwards,
    you will experience another driving style and this process repeats for a few
    rounds.


    If you have any questions, ask the study supervisor at any time.
    You may abort the study at any point without negative consequences.


    Note:
    Please do not interfere with the controls - any hardware input will be disabled.
    The steering whell will continue to turn in correspondence to the autonomous
    vehicle. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
