  m_text: 'You will now experience an autonomous vehicle driving around a predefined
    track with a randomized driving style. After each lap, the simulation will pause
    and you will be asked do give feedback about the previous driving style.


    This
    is done via a slider (ranging from "strongly disagree" to "strongly agree") and
    voice input. Plase select your likeness level and then hold the [ENTER]-key while
    talking about the driving style. You don''t strictly have to give feedback about
    each parameter - simply tell the system what you liked and what you want to change.
    Afterwards, you will experience another driving style and this process repeats
    for a few rounds.


    If you have any questions, ask the study supervisor at
    any time. You may abort the study at any point without negative consequences.


    Note:
    Please do not interfere with the controls - any hardware input will be disabled.
    The steering whell will continue to turn in correspondence to the autonomous
    vehicle. '
