  m_text: "You will now experience two autonomous vehicles at the same time driving
    around a predefined track with a randomized driving style. You will see one vehicle
    on the left side and another one on the right side of the screen. After each
    lap, the simulation will pause and you will be asked do give feedback about the
    previous driving styles.\n\nThis is done via an slider - please select by how
    much you preferred the chosen driving style (left/right). Center means \"neither/nor\"
    and is also a valid answer. \n\nIf you have any questions, ask the study supervisor
    at any time. You may abort the study at any point without negative consequences.\n\nNote:
    For this condion neither the steering wheel nor the plattform will move/turn.
    Please do not interfere with the controls - any hardware input will be disabled.  "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
